ay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107130/extras/64ad649889c3bd42723c37b9a2157d7d.poster.avif?t=1730397951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107130/extras/64ad649889c3bd42723c37b9a2157d7d.webm?t=1730397951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107130/extras/64ad649889c3bd42723c37b9a2157d7d.mp4?t=1730397951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grow and harvest multiple unique plants</strong>, from elder trees to death blooms, all of which will affect your potions in different ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107130/extras/72c237d10b1b9d52f8b33649c1ba6116.avif?t=1730397951\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107130/extras/905ef5003c69ca71987adde3c0739ea7.avif?t=1730397951\" /></div></p>",
